    "Reason : 1 - The proposal, by reason of its design, location and appearance would be out of place within the existing building and cause harm to the character, appearance and uniformity of the Corney Reach Estate and the wider area of the contrary to Local Plan policies CC1, CC2 and CC4 of Local Plan, policies D4 of London Plan and the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal would likely to have a serious and adverse effect on the existing street tree at the adjoining pavement, which in turn would have a detrimental effect on the character and amenity of the locality. As the submission makes no justification or assessment of proposal of impact on the tree, in the absence of Arboricultural Assessment, it would be contrary to Local Plan policies CC1, CC2 and GB7 and the National Planning Policy Framework."
